<LegalPage title="Privacy policy" description="What personal information JC Cabs collects and how it is used.">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    The details you type into our booking and enquiry forms (name, phone, pickup and drop, date and time, and your
    message). The forms open WhatsApp, so the details reach us as a WhatsApp message from you.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To confirm your fare and driver, and to arrange your trip.</li>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
  <p>Website analytics and cookies, and how to opt out: TBD. This section must be completed before analytics are turned on.</p>

  <h2>Sharing and keeping your details</h2>
  <p>Who we share trip details with (for example, your driver) and how long we keep them: TBD.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>To ask us to correct or delete your details, contact us using the details on the Contact page. Response time: TBD.</p>
</LegalPage>
